          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can you recover my car if it's not driveable after a crash?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
